# Keep the build context small: everything ARI needs to build is source; the rest is large or regenerated.
**/.git
**/.github
**/.idea
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/.claude
**/.run
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.user
**/.DS_Store

# Build output and local runtime data
Builds
devbuild
ARI.API/wwwroot
ARI.Console
ARI.Desktop
ARI.sln.DotSettings.user

# Voice engines are vendored repos with their own venvs and weights (~1 GB); the image does not ship them.
VoiceModules
External
Training

# The image itself and its helpers don't need to be inside it
Dockerfile*
docker-compose*.yml
.dockerignore
